        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property Redistribution is a brutal action game with a tactical component. Defeat enemies with the help of your minions, capturing districts and seizing other people's businesses. Defend your territories and profit from them to prevent your enemies from doing the same. Conquer enemy lands, but don't expect a warm welcome: everyone wants to redistribute property in their favor. If you have the strength and cunning, you can help Father solve the problem of a mysterious missing Package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property Redistribution is a hybrid of top-down 2D action and resource management strategy. Play the role of a gang leader who must both plan and fight enemy forces. Remember, a leader is nothing without his followers. Your gang will help you succeed in a harsh world where almost every hit or shot ends in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit - one kill. It's practically a law of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing districts/businesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal combat and world</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property Redistribution is a brutal action game with a tactical component. Defeat enemies with the help of your minions, capturing districts and seizing other people's businesses. Defend your territories and profit from them to prevent your enemies from doing the same. Conquer enemy lands, but don't expect a warm welcome: everyone wants to redistribute property in their favor. If you have the strength and cunning, you can help Father solve the problem of a mysterious missing Package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property Redistribution is a hybrid of top-down 2D action and resource management strategy. Play the role of a gang leader who must both plan and fight enemy forces. Remember, a leader is nothing without his followers. Your gang will help you succeed in a harsh world where almost every hit or shot ends in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit - one kill. It's practically a law of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing districts/businesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal combat and world</p></li></ul>",
